{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026L5WusIhQTz1794370387.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>政府計劃為政府僱員推出「照顧家庭假」，每人每年最多12小時。</p><p></p><p>公務員事務局提交立法會的文件，指「照顧家庭假」容許僱員在特定情況下，短暫離開工作崗位，包括陪同家人應診、照顧患病家人、出席子女的學校活動，以及處理家中突發事宜。假期會以小時為單位，每次可申請放1至4小時，每年最多可放12小時。每年結束未申領的假期不可以帶到下一年。</p><p></p><p>局方表示正敲定細節和實施安排，會在諮詢職方後落實，預計明年1月起實施。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:12:40.701268+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T04:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T19:57:13.895697+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T05:06:07.065667+00:00","content_hash":"87a4c70c1eab82c6b268b89a1864d274a0e64c01c34db4179435236ca8cc4fee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:12:40.701268+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}